  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Plan Sweden Disaster Risk Management and RRM 2013-2014 - Plan Sweden Disaster Risk Management and RRM 2013-</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Plan Sweden Disaster Risk Management and RRM 2013-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det katastrof f&#xf6;rebyggande program f&#xf6;r 2013-2014 som presenteras av   Plan Sverige best&#xe5;r av en mekanism f&#xf6;r snabba insatser samt tre        landsspecifika projekt (Sudan, Pakistan, Filippinerna). Det tv&#xe5;      &#xe5;riga programmet har en total budget p&#xe5; 66,2 MSEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Disaster Risk Management Programme 2013-2014 presented by          Plan Sweden consists of a rapid response mechanism along with three  country specific projects (Sudan, Pakistan, the Philippines). The two year programme has a total budget of 66.2 MSEK.</narrative>
  </description>
